      "content": "a rounded bowl or platter (MED s.v. trendel n.); a vessel of flat rounded form, a round or oval tub used for various purposes, here as a packing unit for wax (OED s.v. trendle n. 4; Gras 763); also used as a packing unit for splintes pro hattes, but exact meaning in that context unknown"
